				"An ancient ruin of remarkable architectural brilliance appears on the &esurface of deep ocean biomes&r. Once a symbol of glory, it has, under unknown influences, become a sunken city filled with Deeplings. Within it, an ancient ritual can summon the Abyssal creature, &dThe Leviathan&r."
