		{
			dependencies: ["27AD335AE6A41756"]
			description: [
				"The &dLich Prison&r naturally generates in the sky above &dOcean biomes&r as a &elarge floating island structure&r. The island contains a ritual altar used to summon the Lich, as well as a massive bone structure. Beneath the bone structure is a lectern holding a book that explains the origin of the structure and its related lore."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&dBoss Activation :&r To summon the &dLich&r, you must first wait until &enight&r, then place three &6Ominous Bone Staff Fragments&r (top, middle, and bottom) in order from left to right into the &edamaged Deepslate core&r in front of the altar. After that, pour a &cVial of Blood&r onto the &6Altar&r block at the center."
				""
				"&7Ruins containing Ominous Bone Staff Fragments generate in forest biomes, appearing in three variants: Old Watchtowers, Blood Sacrifice Pits, and Ruined Camps. Each variant contains different fragment positions (head, torso, tail), which can be identified via visuals.&r"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&cObtaining Vial of Blood:&r"
				""
				"You must craft a &6Bone Dagger&r using three bones. While holding an &6empty glass bottle in your off-hand&r, killing villagers will fill it with blood. After repeating this process 8 times, the glass bottle will transform into a Vial of Blood."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			icon: "graveyard:black_bone_staff"
			id: "6B51398807F1CA21"
			rewards: [{
				id: "659002635C610E7D"
				item: "lightmanscurrency:coin_gold"
				type: "item"
			}]
			subtitle: "Lich"
			tasks: [
